      "sourceTextSha256": "253a8905c667eacc5fc25b0999953eea57b037468949006af68bfac52504d2c7",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. At 8:30 AM, we will embark on a motorboat tour along the Preguiças River. Our first stop will be in Vassouras, also known as \"Little Lençóis,\" where you can enjoy a refreshing coconut water, take photos of the local monkeys, explore a quaint fishing village, and climb the 160 steps leading to the Pérgula Lighthouse, which offers stunning views of the surrounding region, including the dunes, the river and its sources, the ocean, and the local vegetation. Afterward, we will return to São Luís. Accommodation at the Luzeiros Hotel.",
